<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/core#"
     xml:base="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/core"
     xmlns:obo="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:r5r="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:bibo="http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/"
     xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#"
     xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/"
     xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:ssbd="https://w3id.org/ssbd/"
     xmlns:swrl="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#"
     xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
     xmlns:swrlb="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrlb#"
     xmlns:terms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
     xmlns:vocab="https://w3id.org/widoco/vocab#"
     xmlns:cheminf="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/cheminf.owl#"
     xmlns:oboInOwl="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#"
     xmlns:ontologies="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/core">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/core"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/biological-descriptors"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/cheminf-mappings"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/contributors"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/matter"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/models"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/physical-descriptors"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/core/0.0.1/ssbd-taxonomy"/>
        <r5r:status>Under Development</r5r:status>
        <terms:abstract xml:lang="en">The SSbD Core Ontology provides the semantic basis for safe and sustainability by design.

The SSbD Core Ontology expands on the annotation schema provided by tripper, which again expands on the DCAT-AP.

Safe and sustainable by design (SSbD) can be described as an approach that focuses on providing a function (or service), while avoiding onerous environmental footprints and chemical properties that may be harmful to human health or the environment.  In essence, the SSbD approach aims to identifying and minimizing, at an early phase of the innovation process, the impacts concerning safety for humans and the environment and for sustainability, minimizing the environmental footprint, in particular regarding climate change and resource use and, protecting ecosystems and biodiversity, taking a lifecycle perspective. The SSbD approach addresses the safety and sustainability of the material/ chemical/ product and associated processes along the whole life cycle, including all the steps of the research and development (R&amp;D) phase, production, use, recycling, and disposal.

</terms:abstract>
        <terms:bibliographicCitation>xxx</terms:bibliographicCitation>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4250-4584"/>
        <terms:created>2025-09-08</terms:created>
        <terms:hasFormat rdf:resource="https://www.w3.org/TR/turtle/"/>
        <terms:license>https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode</terms:license>
        <terms:publisher rdf:resource="https://pink-project.eu/"/>
        <terms:title xml:lang="en">SSbD Core Ontology</terms:title>
        <bibo:doi>tbd</bibo:doi>
        <bibo:status rdf:resource="http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status/forthcoming"/>
        <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>ssbd</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
        <vann:preferredNamespaceUri>https://w3id.org/ssbd</vann:preferredNamespaceUri>
        <owl:priorVersion>0.0.0</owl:priorVersion>
        <owl:versionInfo>0.0.1</owl:versionInfo>
        <foaf:homepage rdf:resource="https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/"/>
        <foaf:logo rdf:resource="https://tess.elixir-europe.org/system/content_providers/images/000/000/777/original/pink-logo-orange-colorB-500.png"/>
        <vocab:introduction xml:lang="en">
The SSbD Core Ontology has a modular structure and aims to cover the following features:

* Allow to categorise resources (datasets, models, software, etc) according to their SSbD dimensions and categories/sub-categories.
* Provenance, based on the [PROV-O](https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/) ontology. PROV-O is fully adapted by the SSbD Core Ontology, having the three top-level PROV-O classes, *Activity*, *Entity* and *Agent* in root.
* Extension of the basic PROV-O provenance to complex scientific workflows with spatial and temporal parts.
* Allow documentation of workflows that have not (yet) been executed. Such documentation is done at class-level. When executed individuals should be created for the evaluated activities and their input and output providing a full PROV-O provenance graph.
* Top-level taxonomy for (advanced) materials and chemicals based on [EMMO](https://emmc.eu/emmo/) with mappings to [ChEBI](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/) for chemicals.
* Categorisation models.
* Strong taxonomy for relations, which are grouped into:
  - [parthood relations](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/docs/background.html#parthood-relations), based on mereology
  - [causal relations](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/docs/background.html#causal-relations), based on causality
  - [semiotic relations](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/docs/background.html#semiotic-relations), based on [Pierse semiotics](https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/peirce-semiotics/)

Separate reference documentations exists for the following sub-modules:

* [ddoc](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/widoco-ddoc/index-en.html): The Tripper data documentation vocabulary, with terms reused from other ontologies and vocabularies. Mainly [Dublin Core](https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/), [FOAF](http://xmlns.com/foaf/spec/) and similar basic vocabularies.
* [reused-terms](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/widoco-reused-terms/index-en.html): Additional reused terms by the SSbD Core Ontology ([DCAT](https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-3/), [PROV-O](https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/), etc).
* [matter](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/widoco-matter/index-en.html): Taxonomy for (advanced) materials and chemicals
* [models](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/widoco-models/index-en.html): Taxonomy for models.

The root of the SSbD Core Ontology is shown below. More information can be found in the [background](https://ssbd-ontology.github.io/core/docs/background.html) section.

</vocab:introduction>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Annotation properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    


    <!-- http://data.europa.eu/r5r/status -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/status"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/created -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/created"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasFormat -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasFormat"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status"/>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/is_output_or -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/is_output_or">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#altLabel -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#altLabel"/>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasGeneratedBy -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasGeneratedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasGeneratedBy"/>
    </owl:AnnotationProperty>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Object Properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136 -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isPropertyOf"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000056 -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000056">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/participatesTo"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/accessRights -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/accessRights">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart"/>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/license -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/license">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/rightsHolder -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/rightsHolder">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isRepresentedBy"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#theme -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#theme">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom"/>
    


    <!-- http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/page -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/page"/>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/emmo/application/datadoc#curator -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo/application/datadoc#curator">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/datamodel#datamodel -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/datamodel#datamodel">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDescription"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/assesses -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/assesses">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Assessment"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">assesses</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an assessment to the entity it assesses. Can e.g. be a semantically defined thematic area.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">assesses</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/attributed -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/attributed">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">attributed</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an agent to an entity via an activity that both the agent and entity participates to.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">attributed</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The activity is through overlapped by the agent and overcrossed by the entity.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">There may or may not be a causal interaction between the agent and entity.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/causal -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causal">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">causal</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The root of all causal SSbD relations.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">causal</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Causality is the fundamental concept describing how entities affect each other.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasInfluencedBy"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causal"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">caused by</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A relation between an owl:Thing (entity, activity or agent) that causally affects the subject.</skos:definition>
        <skos:example xml:lang="en">John yesterday is the cause of John today, is an example of temporal-like causality. The desk supporting my laptop is a space-like causality.</skos:example>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">causedBy</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/chemicalClass -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/chemicalClass">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Matter"/>
        <vann:usageNote xml:lang="en">Choose one of subclasses of ssbd:Matter.</vann:usageNote>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">chemical class</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a thing to a chemical class that the thing is relevant for.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">chemicalClass</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/documentation -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/documentation">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/page"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isRepresentedBy"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">documentation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a resource to a page or document documenting this resource.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">documentation</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/equalsTo -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/equalsTo">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasPart"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
            <rdf:Description>
                <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasPart"/>
            </rdf:Description>
        </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
        <owl:propertyDisjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">equals to</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between two indeviduals representing the same entity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:editorialNote>The main purpose of this relation is to locically define hasProperPart.</skos:editorialNote>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">equalsTo</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDatum -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDatum">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Dataset"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Datum"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has datum</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a dataset to its datum.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasDatum</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDescription -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDescription">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isRepresentedBy"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Description"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has description</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a thing to a description (i.e. collection of properties) of the thing.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasDescription</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasInput -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasInput">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has input</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an activity to an entity that is input to the activity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasInput</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The activity A proper overlaps the entity E, where the non-overlapping part of E causes A.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasJunctionPart -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasJunctionPart">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has junction part</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">hasSpatioTemporalPart</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The part is connected with the rest item or members with both hasNext (or its inverse) and hasContact relations.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasJunctionPart</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasMeasurementUnit -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasMeasurementUnit">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDescription"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Property"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has unit</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a property to its unit.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasUnit</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">`ssbd:hasMeasurementUnit` is intended to refer to a unit in an existing unit ontology, like QUDT or EMMO.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasOutput -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasOutput">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has output</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an activity to an entity that is the output of the activity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasOutput</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The activity A proper overlaps the entity E, where the non-overlapping part of E is caused by A.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasPart -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasPart">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/overlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ReflexiveProperty"/>
        <owl:propertyDisjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOvercrossedBy"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has part</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The primitive relation that express the concept of an entity being part of another one.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasPart</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">OWL2 does not allow non-simple (e.g. transitive) properties to appear in disjoint property axioms. We therefore implement the transitivity of hasPart using SWRL rules instead of asserting it with owl:TransitiveProperty.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasParticipant -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasParticipant">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has participant</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between a process and an object participating to it, i.e. that is relevant to the process itself.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasParticipant</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Participation is a parthood relation - you must be part of the process to contribute to it. A participant whose 4D extension is totally contained within the process.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has proper part</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between an entity and one of its parts, when both entities are distinct.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasProperPart</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isRepresentedBy"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Property"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has property</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a thing to one of its properties.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasProperty</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasSoftware -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasSoftware">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/performedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Computation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Software"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has software</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">hasSoftwareAgent</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a computation to the software used to perform the computation.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasSoftware</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasSpatialPart -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasSpatialPart">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has spatial part</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A proper part of a whole, whose parts always cover the full temporal extension of the whole within a spatial interval.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasSpatialPart</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The part is connected with the rest item or members with hasContact relations only (no hasNext).</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasSubProcess -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasSubProcess">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Process"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Process"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has sub process</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between a process and one of its process parts.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasSubProcess</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasTemporalPart -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasTemporalPart">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has temporal part</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A relation that identify a proper item part of the whole, whose parts always cover the full spatial extension of the whole within a time interval.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasTemporalPart</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A temporal part of an item cannot both cause and be caused by any other proper part of the item.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/implementsModel -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/implementsModel">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Software"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Model"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">implements model</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a software to the model it implements.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">implementsModel</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Semiotically a software can be seen as an executable sign that stands for the model it implements.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/inTierLevel -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/inTierLevel">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/TierLevel"/>
        <vann:usageNote xml:lang="en">Should be one of: ssbd:tierlevel1 (ideation/design), ssbd:tierlevel2 (lab phase/development), ssbd:tierlevel3 (up-scaling/production)</vann:usageNote>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">in tier level</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relate a thing to an SSbD tier level.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">inTierLevel</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isAfter -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isAfter">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is after</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A one-directional relation between an entity that affects the subject.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isAfter</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isDescriptionFor -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isDescriptionFor">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDescription"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Description"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is description for</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a description to a thing.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isDescriptionFor</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isInterpretedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isInterpretedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/semiotical"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Sign"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Interpreter"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is interpreted by</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a sign (e.g. a property) to an interpreter.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isInterpretedBy</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOutputOf -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOutputOf">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasOutput"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is output of</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The inverse of hasOutput. Relates an entity to an activity of which the entity is an output.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isOutputOf</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOvercrossedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOvercrossedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/overlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is overcrossed by</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between an entity that overlaps another without having it as part.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isOvercrossedBy</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isPropertyFor -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isPropertyFor">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Property"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is property for</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a property to a thing.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isPropertyFor</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isRepresentedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isRepresentedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/semiotical"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Sign"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is represented by</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a thing to a sign that stands for the thing.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isRepresentedBy</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/isSubmoduleOf -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isSubmoduleOf">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/parthood"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
            <rdf:Description>
                <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasProperPart"/>
            </rdf:Description>
        </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Software"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Software"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is submodule of</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">isSoftwareSubmoduleOf</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A parthood relation that relates a submodule of a software to the software.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">isSubmoduleOf</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/notOverlaps -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/notOverlaps">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/parthood"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <owl:propertyDisjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/overlaps"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">not overlaps</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between two individuals that does not share any parts.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">notOverlaps</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/outputsIndicator -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/outputsIndicator">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasOutput"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Assessment"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Property"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">outputs indicator</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An output property of the Assessment that is intended to be an indicator in the given context.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">outputsIndicator</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">By referring to a Property as object it is is possible to search the KB for indicators as outputs.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/overlaps -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/overlaps">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/parthood"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ReflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">overlaps</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between two individuals representing entities that share at least one of their parts.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">overlaps</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/parthood -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/parthood">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">parthood</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The root of SSbD parthood relations.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">parthood</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The SSbD parthood relations adhere to Atomistic General Extensional Mereology (AGEM).</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/participatesTo -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/participatesTo">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">participates to</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relation an entity to an activity that it interacts with.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">participatesTo</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The entity through overlaps the activity.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/performedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/performedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
            <rdf:Description>
                <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/participatesTo"/>
            </rdf:Description>
        </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/hume#IntentionalAgent"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">performed by</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">hasIntentionalAgent</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an activity to an intentional agent that drives the activity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">performedBy</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/performedWith -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/performedWith">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf>
            <rdf:Description>
                <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/participatesTo"/>
            </rdf:Description>
        </rdfs:subPropertyOf>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/hume#UnintentionalAgent"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">performed with</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">hasUnintentionalAgent</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an activity to an unintentional agent that drives the activity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">performedWith</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/priorRelease -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/priorRelease">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Resource"/>
        <vann:usageNote xml:lang="en">Useful for tracking the provenance of software and dataset releases.</vann:usageNote>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">prior release</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a resource to its most resent earlier release.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">priorRelease</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/processedFrom -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/processedFrom">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isAfter"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">processed from</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Indirect relation that relates the output of an activity to its input.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">processedFrom</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOvercrossedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">proper overlaps</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The relation between two entities that overlaps and neither of them is a part of the other.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">properOverlaps</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/providesInterpretation -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/providesInterpretation">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/semiotical"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Interpreter"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">provides interpretation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A relation that connects the interpreter to the referent in a semiotic process.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">providesInterpretation</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/semiotical -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/semiotical">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">semiotical</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The base of all semiotic relations.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">semiotical</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Semiotic relations can be seen as shortcuts that replaces a series of complex causal relations with a single relation.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Semiotic relations take part in a triadic semiotic meaning-making process, where an &apos;interpreter&apos; connects a &apos;sign&apos; (e.g. a property) to a &apos;thing&apos; (aka &apos;referent&apos;).</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The semiotic relations in the SSbD Core Ontology are inspirred by EMMO, which in turn is based on the semiotic theory by Charles Sanders Peirce (1839-1914).</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/standsFor">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/semiotical"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Sign"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">stands for</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Connects a sign (e.g. a property) to a thing (a &apos;referent&apos;).</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">standsFor</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/used -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/used">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#used"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasInput"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">used</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an activity to an entity that it used.</skos:definition>
        <skos:example>For example, :baking :used :spoon, :egg, :oven .</skos:example>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">used</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The activity A proper overlaps the entity E, where the non-overlapping part of E causes A.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAssociatedWith"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was associated with</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an activity to an agent that had some (unspecified) responsibility for the occurence of this activity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">wasAssociatedWith</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The activity is through overlapped by the agent.</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was attributed to</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates an entity to an agent via an activity that both the entity and agent participates to.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">wasAttributedTo</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The activity is through overlapped by the agent and overcrossed by the entity.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This relation connects PROV-O with causal theory of the SSbD Core Ontology</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasDerivedFrom -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasDerivedFrom">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/processedFrom"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was derived from</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Indirect relation that relates the output entity of an activity to its input entity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">wasDerivedFrom</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This relation connects PROV-O with causal theory of the SSbD Core Ontology</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasGeneratedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasGeneratedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isOutputOf"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasInformedBy -->


    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasInformedBy">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasInformedBy"/>
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/isAfter"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was informed by</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A one-directional relation between an activity that affects the subject activity.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">wasInformedBy</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This relation connects PROV-O with causal theory of the SSbD Core Ontology</skos:scopeNote>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Data properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    


    <!-- http://semanticscience.org/resource/CHEMINF_000012 -->


    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://semanticscience.org/resource/CHEMINF_000012">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasDataValue"/>
    </rdf:Description>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/dataValue -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/dataValue">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Data"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">data value</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a data individual to its literal value.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">dataValue</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasAPI -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasAPI">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Software"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has API</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the software has an API.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasAPI</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasGUI -->


    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ssbd/hasGUI">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ssbd/Software"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has GUI</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Whether the software has a GUI.</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">hasGUI</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


